p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Fumarate hydratase&ndash;deficient renal cell carcinoma</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">(rare: phaeochromocytoma/paraganglioma, Leydig cell tumour)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Associated benign tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 368.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"491\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Leiomyoma (cutaneous and uterine)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cancer-related inheritance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 368.6pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"491\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Autosomal dominant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Chromosome location</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 368.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"491\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-fam